{"id":"en_the-trash-princess-is-the-dragon-empress","title":"The Trash Princess Is The Dragon Empress","titleEn":"The Trash Princess Is The Dragon Empress","description":"In Aslan, a realm ruled by magic, Princess Rosalind—the eldest daughter—possessed power no one could detect, so the kingdom dismissed her as a worthless failure. As he lay dying, the king placed her in the care of three companions raised at her side: Ryan, who commanded the army; Evan, skilled in sacred arts; and Kyle, keeper of the treasury. Though bound by oath to shield her, the three turned on her at her coronation, raising Lily—the sister Rosalind cherished, who had grown up in refugee camps—to the throne in her place.\n\nThree betrayals drew three blood-tears from Rosalind, awakening the Ember Tear, a dark stone her father had left behind. When Lily smashed Rosalind's necklace before the court, the ancient dragon blood inside her burst free. Rosalind absorbed the kingdom's magic, and A","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-trash-princess-is-the-dragon-empress/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-trash-princess-is-the-dragon-empress/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Strong Female Lead","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjnt4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-trash-princess-is-the-dragon-empress_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjnt4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-trash-princess-is-the-dragon-empress_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjnt4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-trash-princess-is-th